# Purpose
Orchestrates auth, Cloudflare sync, activate/takeover, local prefs.

# API Catalog
- loginOAuth / loginApiToken / logout
- listTunnels / createTunnel / updateTunnel / deleteTunnel
- activateTunnel(tunnelId, takeover) — throws TAKEOVER_REQUIRED if remote connectors and !takeover
- deactivateTunnel / restoreOnLaunch
